{"applicability_conditions":"用于计算奥氏体的 M_d30 温度；元素含量以质量百分比（mass percentage）表示；适用于本文 H70~H90 钢（低碳、含 Mn、Al 的 TRIP 钢）的奥氏体化学成分；系数为经验回归系数（引用文献 [34,35]）。","identity":{"block_id":"b0055","equation_id":"equation_003","equation_number":"3","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\mathrm{M} _ {\\mathrm{d} 3 0} (^ {\\circ} \\mathrm{C}) = 4 9 7 - 4 6 2 (\\mathrm{C} + \\mathrm{N}) - 2 0 \\mathrm{Ni} - 1 8. 5 \\mathrm{Mo} - 1 3. 7 \\mathrm{Cr} - 8. 1 \\mathrm{Mn} - 9. 2 \\mathrm{Si}\\tag{3}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.msea.2017.10.039"},"latex":"\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{d}30}(^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}) = 497 - 462(\\mathrm{C} + \\mathrm{N}) - 20\\mathrm{Ni} - 18.5\\mathrm{Mo} - 13.7\\mathrm{Cr} - 8.1\\mathrm{Mn} - 9.2\\mathrm{Si}","purpose":"根据奥氏体的化学成分（质量百分比）计算 M_d30 温度，即在该温度下、施加30%真应变时50%的奥氏体已转变为马氏体，用于讨论 H70~H90 钢中奥氏体的稳定性。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"在30%真应变时50%奥氏体转变为马氏体的温度","symbol":"\\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{d}30}","unit":"°C","value":"H90: 249 °C; H80: 204 °C; H70: 268 °C"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"碳含量（质量百分比）","symbol":"\\mathrm{C}","unit":"mass %","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"氮含量（质量百分比）","symbol":"\\mathrm{N}","unit":"mass %","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"镍含量（质量百分比）","symbol":"\\mathrm{Ni}","unit":"mass %","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"钼含量（质量百分比）","symbol":"\\mathrm{Mo}","unit":"mass %","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"铬含量（质量百分比）","symbol":"\\mathrm{Cr}","unit":"mass %","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"锰含量（质量百分比）","symbol":"\\mathrm{Mn}","unit":"mass %","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"硅含量（质量百分比）","symbol":"\\mathrm{Si}","unit":"mass %","value":null}],"unmapped":["公式中的数值系数（497、462、20、18.5、13.7、8.1、9.2）为经验回归系数，论文未逐一解释其含义。","对应的 M_s 计算式（公式2）为 Ms(°C) = 539 - 423C - 30.4Mn - 12.1Cr - 17.7Ni - 7.5Mo + 10Co - 7.3Si。","奥氏体中 C 含量由 XRD 分析测定，Mn 和 Al 含量由 EDS 分析测定。"]}